bunnysdk-rs includes logic adapted from the official bunny.net TypeScript client
(@bunny.net/openapi-client, https://github.com/BunnyWay/cli), used under the
MIT License:

  - Normalisation of bunny.net API error responses (src/error.rs)
  - The list of official OpenAPI spec URLs (xtask/src/main.rs)

The files in specs/ are bunny.net's published OpenAPI documents
(copyright BunnyWay d.o.o.), included to generate src/generated/.

